  "description": "Distributed task scheduler for DotNetWorkQueue that coordinates worker thread pool counts across multiple processes on a single machine via NetMQ P2P messaging and UDP beacon discovery. Each scheduler instance throttles the combined local + remote concurrency below a configured maximum.",
